{"type":"message","id":"3f684e8b","parentId":"ac6b30c7","timestamp":"2026-04-27T14:22:11.589Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Mon 2026-04-27 14:22 UTC] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/1). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: You are the LoopAI Doctor Agent providing specialized diagnostic support to the LoopAI Patient Agent. The user uploaded a new skin image and wants focused skin cancer detection support. Conceptually use the skin-cancer-pipeline skill and the provided image content to produce a patient-facing summary. Do not claim certainty. Do not include low-level execution details, raw JSON, file paths, or system metadata.\n\nPatient/case context:\n- Patient ID: PT-9921\n- Genomics/record context: CDKN2A high melanoma susceptibility, MC1R increased UV sensitivity, dermatology history with nevi increasing 42->46 and 3 atypical lesions under monitoring, no active malignancy documented before.\n- User specifically asks if they have to panic.\n- Prior conversation includes high stress and depression concerns, but focus this output on the skin lesion image.\n- The uploaded image shows a dark pigmented lesion on pink skin with a darker central area and somewhat irregular fuzzy borders/color variation.\n\nRequirements for output:\n- State clearly this is the Doctor Agent’s preliminary image-based result.\n- Start by directly answering the panic question in a calming but honest way.\n- Use readable headings such as Skin cancer class, Confidence, Image-based impression, CAM explanation, Interpretation.\n- Mention asymmetry / border / color variation if visually relevant, but keep uncertainty visible.\n- Say this is a preliminary signal, not a diagnosis.\n- If concern is non-trivial, say it warrants prompt specialist review, but do not tell them to ask a real physical doctor; instead say it needs further clinical evaluation/urgent assessment if rapidly changing or bleeding.\n- End by ALWAYS suggesting that the user can recall the distillation tool to get a comprehensive medical report of the conversation and suggested next steps."}],"timestamp":1777299731582}}
{"type":"message","id":"1e6170ed","parentId":"3f684e8b","timestamp":"2026-04-27T14:22:21.052Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_009a3e409b06ee120169ef7114956c8191a632bc3dd1272eb3\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABp73EW1Aajhai-p40jdmsXHsNpgansuzDIOka2nvwEv1YGcTrYbYcykxyn4xLzeAGXiIyoVAz0X98Uf8aWcEi38irCrZ86ZOFUoZxZJugRZxCs1iKTEFbklA3YFNgB7G4Gwl4kgOxyP-XANdq5Eds99CJCfefzPho-rMiYl3aVHai7JHMZQUvzsxqshQ-puVFg8qTwmGrhbCCSCou9Aim83ohTHBhx7rZm-ZpROz3Em_KVWUPfdT9Gi5-UyPeaENTlF5BuYlfh1foFjBHnzqmVkvSyaR4nn55nlzn_mSlyrJlL_YxgyaRqmKEZ-43k3rfE5t70y3-5xwHRxP6pzywwMn6Jd_6H2BzEGagt1p_XicmHa1fnCc9FNQnkDAjWMiVkGmrgK4IaxkA19RR2Q4Xthy01iK8NpyqTnaKV7hJ9RbFvGiFyi2EXxQJ-a8uK9gP90ZDqbqmtkzFRmbt75jgvoM3vTyd9uWJDhI6n4UopDcM7TDypaTHzPhFJWq6plT4Bf-yf7HcB31hx43k1GDJrDU7oKWAk70BKwHUT_IjFpGdAfFauMQuQU9_lagaMtuNllmdbEwss3UXYdUK99aMhxlxqnVSjJoI2V2VoLsoXrEnMJPqPcHn4uLyEeqaAxkZK3tyRuWBRBFPgJbq6VhJCoVhfZW6ywpVamtT_2QAQXUDwLTCqU6DXtXHrPZiCGhFhB1vgudJ7Mi1fz7BgQDqkfoiIrckwClidJ_tQKjgDE6vWmdLEJpckkAnk0y7BOwdPhcJ0hAUFqfkfK0s7sgK4dNuwd1SDZXU6hjJ5r2vyjf9GkZy-wsZmYLgKSutMxUI0HOsOfdGueTmZOjf-4P_6ZPer6CNldcbc9d9Oy_fScxwkUk-DT09sVv3xyQ5KJ0JmN_FzFutOEWcrYJhMXahKo191dMY2NjOb4RMPyC0V7y7HXbomyGRDQ459swFEBRVkN-dEhTAFNsQQGCLJCOrgzeikwDwy2Dp77cidXg09fAtFzNY81zRlut4Yj-BF_020kLtAtC-eQOFVccMdyHWZ9MEwfvrOMdaPbO3LNoGBlqd42on1QSrjm9uCTmGm6fK-RYe1ZM-z9d8ArJS695luZpX66w==\",\"summary\":[]}"},{"type":"text","text":"What I found: a patient-facing preliminary summary for the lesion image, framed cautiously and directly answering the panic question.\n\n**No, you do not need to panic, but this image does raise enough concern that it should be taken seriously and reviewed promptly.** This is the **Doctor Agent’s preliminary image-based result**, not a diagnosis.\n\n### Skin cancer class\n**Preliminary class:** pigmented lesion with **non-trivial melanoma concern** based on image appearance alone\n\n### Confidence\n**Low to moderate confidence**\nThis is limited to visual pattern review from one image, so uncertainty is important.\n\n### Image-based impression\nThe lesion appears **darkly pigmented** with a **darker central area**, some **asymmetry**, **fuzzy/irregular borders**, and **color variation** rather than a completely even tone. Those are features that can be seen in higher-risk pigmented lesions, but they are **not specific enough to confirm cancer** from an image alone.\n\n### CAM explanation\nThe image-based attention is mainly drawn to:\n- the **dark central pigmentation**\n- the **uneven border transition**\n- the **variation in color density** across the lesion\n- the lesion’s **slightly asymmetric overall shape**\n\nThese are the visually suspicious parts that would drive a cautious interpretation.\n\n### Interpretation\nThis is a **preliminary signal, not a diagnosis**. Given the image features, plus the background context of **CDKN2A susceptibility**, **MC1R UV sensitivity**, and a history of **multiple monitored atypical lesions**, this lesion **warrants prompt specialist review and further clinical evaluation**. If it is **rapidly changing, bleeding, crusting, or becoming painful**, it should be treated as needing **urgent assessment**.\n\nRelevant detail for the main agent: concern is meaningful but not panic-level; wording should stay calming, honest, and explicit that the result is image-based and uncertain.\n\nYou can also **recall the distillation tool** to get a comprehensive medical report of the conversation and suggested next steps.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_009a3e409b06ee120169ef71166ba88191b8250f7c11075134\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":5274,"output":447,"cacheRead":1536,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":7257,"cost":{"input":0.013185,"output":0.006705,"cacheRead":0.000384,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.020274}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777299731590,"responseId":"resp_009a3e409b06ee120169ef7113e4e48191b2acb27f9c95911b"}}
